   "text": "设 \\(X_{1},X_{2},\\cdots,X_{2n}\\)（\\(n>2\\)）为来自总体 \\(N(0,1)\\) 的简单随机样本，则下列选项错误的是\nA. \\(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2n-1}\\,X_{1}}{\\sqrt{\\sum\\limits_{i=2}^{2n}X_{i}^{2}}}\\sim t(2n-1)\\).\nB. \\(\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{2n}\\left(X_{i}-\\dfrac{1}{2n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{2n}X_{i}\\right)^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(2n)\\).\nC. \\(\\dfrac{(2n-3)\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{3}X_{i}^{2}}{3\\sum\\limits_{i=4}^{2n}X_{i}^{2}}\\sim F(3,2n-3)\\).\nD. \\(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{2n}X_{i}^{2}+\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}X_{2i-1}X_{2i}\\sim\\chi^{2}(n)\\).",
